ANALYSIS: level_12: location "Level 012 - Witch" GUARDED — the Witch trades the Dark Sword FOR the Wand. The trade is a dialogue in a room nothing gates, so no crossing can ever carry it. (NPCs/Witch.as:47-52 — `doneTalking()` spawns the DarkSword only under `Main.hasWand && !Main.hasDarkSword`)
ANALYSIS: level_19: location "Level 019 - Shieldspire" GUARDED — the ShieldBoss dies to strikes while its shield is moved; the overlay rules the sword the only reachable arm in D2. (Enemies/ShieldBoss.as:130-150 (hit) + Player.as:1099 — the overlay's `shieldboss` row)
ANALYSIS: level_32: location "Level 032 - Bob Boss" GUARDED — Fire is a boss DROP in an arena you walk into freely, so the fight is the gate and the location is the only place to hang it. (Enemies/BobBoss.as:185-199 — the THIRD BobBoss's death is what adds the Fire; the fight is started by `FallRockLarge.as:115-117`)
ANALYSIS: level_32: location "Level 032 - Times" GUARDED — the third BobBoss's death IS the kill; the Fire drop (`fire@L32`) is priced the same. (Enemies/BobBoss.as:167-179 (hit, no `onlyHitBy`) + :181-199 (the third death) — as `fire@L32`)
ANALYSIS: level_43: location "Level 043 - Wand" GUARDED — the vanilla Wand cannot be taken until all five parts are held, and it lies in the totem's arena, so this is a location guard and not a crossing. The weapon half is kept as it stood (stricter than the source; R4b changes no existing guard's condition here). (Pickups/Wand.as:78 (inert until `Player.hasAllTotemParts()`) + Dungeon4/Boss.oel:238 — the Wand and the totem share one arena)
ANALYSIS: level_43: location "Level 043 - Totem of Lacste" GUARDED — the fight starts only with all five parts, and only a Wand shot damages the totem. (Enemies/BossTotem.as:262 (`onlyHitBy = "Wand"`) + Enemy.as:149 + r4-boss-report ccdf189 (the fight waits for `Player.hasAllTotemParts()`); upstream Rules.py:660-667)
ANALYSIS: level_57: location "Level 057 - Tentacled Beast" GUARDED — the beast dies when its eight tentacles are cut — the sword, the spear or a wand shot (`TENTACLE_ARENA`). (Enemies/TentacleBeast.as:93-104 (`maxTentacles <= 0` → dead) + Enemies/Tentacle.as:52,66 (hitsMax 1, `canHit` while sitting; no `onlyHitBy`))
ANALYSIS: level_69: location "Level 069 - Lights" GUARDED — every LightBoss flier dies to the sword, the spear or a wand shot (`LIGHTS_ARENA`); the controller clears its tag when the last goes. (Enemies/LightBoss.as:47 (hitsMax 3; no `onlyHitBy`) + LightBossController.as:102-108 (endState))
ANALYSIS: level_82: location "Level 082 - King of Fire" GUARDED — the King of Fire is hurt only after its own LavaBall is struck back into it; a strike needs a weapon. (Enemies/LavaBoss.as:143-160 (hit needs a LavaBall first) + Projectiles/LavaBall.as:45-53,75 + Player.as:1129-1132 (a strike reflects the ball))
ANALYSIS: level_112: location "Level 112 - Owl" GUARDED — the Owl only takes damage from lava, and the player drives it there by the knockback of any strike; a strike needs a weapon. (Enemies/FinalBoss.as:61 (`onlyHitBy = "Lava"`) + :116-123 (a lava tile hits it) + Enemy.as:173-178 (a filtered hit still knocks back) — the overlay's `finalboss` row)
ANALYSIS: level_81: DROPPED — no link in the whole map reaches it and it holds nothing
