ANALYSIS: level_12: out_teleporter_32_848 CHARGED its approach by hand — the door to L83 stands on a cave tile whose only approach crosses the stacked key-4-and-wand lock, so using it costs what the lock costs. (Dungeon-side region1.oel:2969-2971 + the stacked bosslock{keyType 4} + magicallock at L12 (2,54) + worlds/seedling/Rules.py Dark Shield)
